  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.TargetOne>Cible : {0}</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.TargetOne>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.CountPrefix>Cibles affectées : {0} - {1}</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.CountPrefix>
  <RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.AndMore>, et {0} de plus</RimWorldAccess.Abilities.Affected.AndMore>

